  "remarks": "Afghan Money Service Provider License Number: 044. Haji Khairullah Haji Sattar Money Exchange was used by Taliban leadership to transfer money to Taliban commanders to fund fighters and operations in Afghanistan as of 2011. Active in Kunar Province. Associated with Abdul Sattar Abdul Manan (TAi.162) and Khairullah Barakzai Khudai Nazar (TAi.163) INTERPOL-UN Security Council Special Notice:https://www.interpol.int/en/How-we-work/Notices/View-UN-Notices-Entities",
